      "message": "\u003e We could definitely expand the scope\n\nAh now I understand. It currently tracks only static dependencies such that you don\u0027t include a library that uses hidden apis. It would have to be extended to track \"don\u0027t allow linking against a library that _exports_ hidden apis\" (like framework does).\n\nNot really sure I understand the second point w.r.t sdk_version vs min_sdk_version.",
